--- Result-Day DNS Load Calculation (150,000 students, 40 cities/resolvers) ---
  - TTL = 300 s -> 12 queries/hr per resolver x 40 resolvers = 480 queries/hr total!
  - TTL =  30 s -> 120 queries/hr per resolver x 40 resolvers = 4800 queries/hr total!
  - Risk of very long TTL (e.g. 24h): Moving result server mid-day leaves stale IPs cached for hours.
  - Recommended Result-Day TTL: 300 s (5 min) pre-event, lowered to 60 s only during planned cutover.

